  "Your federated address and connected instances": ["Il tuo indirizzo federato e le istanze collegate", "Je gefedereerde adres en verbonden instances", "Federe adresin ve bağlı sunucular", "Vaše federovaná adresa a propojené instance", "連合アドレスと接続中のインスタンス"],
  "About this instance": ["Informazioni su questa istanza", "Over deze instance", "Bu sunucu hakkında", "O této instanci", "このインスタンスについて"],
  "Rules, terms, privacy and version": ["Regole, termini, privacy e versione", "Regels, voorwaarden, privacy en versie", "Kurallar, şartlar, gizlilik ve sürüm", "Pravidla, podmínky, soukromí a verze", "ルール、規約、プライバシー、バージョン"],
